WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:09.040
Hey youtubers it's Charlie and because Korra
is back today I wanted to talk about the Top

00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:18.450
5 Book 3 Characters I'm most excited about.
Almost everybody is back from Book 2, sans

00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:25.450
Dark Avatar, but there will be several new
ones too.

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:35.320
Just as a heads up, because I'm at VidCon
right now it might take me a little bit longer

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:41.430
to get my reviews up tonight. The first episode
starts at 7PM Eastern Time on Nickelodeon.

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:43.320
Be sure to subscribe to get everything. I'm
doing a special giveaway. I'll explain at

00:00:43.320 --> 00:00:44.230
the end of this video.

00:00:44.230 --> 00:00:48.510
I don't want to spoil any big character reveals,
so these favorites only include people that

00:00:48.510 --> 00:00:54.370
have appeared in the trailer. Just in case,
careful for mild Book 3 spoilers on character

00:00:54.370 --> 00:01:00.680
names. Everybody ready, here we go. Number
5 - Airbending Bumi

00:01:00.680 --> 00:01:04.739
If you've seen the other Korra videos I've
been doing lately you know I'm attributing

00:01:04.739 --> 00:01:09.700
all the new Airbenders to Harmonic Convergence,
it's a timey wimey explanation. But the idea

00:01:09.700 --> 00:01:13.260
is that it changed the spiritual alignment
of the physical world.

00:01:13.260 --> 00:01:17.210
Before, the physical realm was very much cut
off from the spirit world and now that isn't

00:01:17.210 --> 00:01:21.840
an issue anymore, so benders are popping up
everywhere. And I just love the idea of Tenzin

00:01:21.840 --> 00:01:26.340
having to teach Bumi to master Airbending.
It's going to be really funny, but I think

00:01:26.340 --> 00:01:29.650
it's going to bring the children of Aang together
in a way they weren't before.

00:01:29.650 --> 00:01:34.710
During book 2 you could see that there were
a lot of old resentments that they had never

00:01:34.710 --> 00:01:38.590
dealt with until the crisis with the dark
spirits and the Dark Avatar. Now that Bumi

00:01:38.590 --> 00:01:42.510
is a bender, he won't feel like such an outsider
in his own family.

00:01:42.510 --> 00:01:47.240
And Tenzin will have the satisfaction of honoring
their father's legacy by teaching his older

00:01:47.240 --> 00:01:48.630
brother about the family business.

00:01:48.630 --> 00:01:52.290
I know it sounds really melodramatic and cat's
in the cradle. But mostly I think it will

00:01:52.290 --> 00:01:55.869
be a lot of funny moments like Vacation Tenzin
in book 2.

00:01:55.869 --> 00:02:00.880
Think of the Children of Aang as like the
three stooges. I don't know which ones are

00:02:00.880 --> 00:02:02.659
Larry, Moe or Curly.

00:02:02.659 --> 00:02:06.000
That doesn't really address Kya in the Book
3 trailer kicking ass, but I'll talk more

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:08.959
about her in my review of the first couple
of episodes tonight. Because Bumi won't be

00:02:08.959 --> 00:02:13.180
the only child of Aang going through significant
changes.

00:02:13.180 --> 00:02:18.329
Number 4 - Lin Beifong both Young and Old
We saw a bunch of young Lin flashbacks in

00:02:18.329 --> 00:02:21.079
the trailers and Mike and Bryan have said
for a long time that Book 3 would feature

00:02:21.079 --> 00:02:27.439
her a lot. In present day she's going to be
dealing with her family history and her early

00:02:27.439 --> 00:02:32.559
life in Republic City working for her mother's
police force. Yay for more Toph flashbacks.

00:02:32.559 --> 00:02:36.069
I don't quite know how her family story will
weave into the main story about the evil bending

00:02:36.069 --> 00:02:39.769
team, but for the first couple of episodes
they'll probably just be treated as separate

00:02:39.769 --> 00:02:42.209
plot lines.

00:02:42.209 --> 00:02:45.719
That metal city in the trailers is the home
of the Metal Bending Clan. We'll learn all

00:02:45.719 --> 00:02:50.059
about them on Friday. Because Toph and the
idea of Metalbending are so connected in the

00:02:50.059 --> 00:02:54.790
Avatar Universe, I'm totally not surprised
that a metal bending city would be part of

00:02:54.790 --> 00:02:56.049
Lin Beifong's past.

00:02:56.049 --> 00:03:00.590
We haven't really seen a lot of her character
in Book 1 and 2. For the most part she has

00:03:00.590 --> 00:03:04.519
only been a part of the Republic City parts
of the story. I know a lot of you guys who

00:03:04.519 --> 00:03:09.529
were watching my Book 2 videos weren't a huge
fan of what was done with her character last

00:03:09.529 --> 00:03:09.769
year.

00:03:09.769 --> 00:03:15.849
I did feel like she was a bigger part of the
story in Book 1, but I think a lot of the

00:03:15.849 --> 00:03:22.469
reason she wasn't around in Book 2 was because
the story was mostly Water Tribe based. Now

00:03:22.469 --> 00:03:26.559
that they're traveling to the Earth Kingdom
it's only natural that Lin would become a

00:03:26.559 --> 00:03:28.370
much bigger part of the story.

00:03:28.370 --> 00:03:32.659
I remember the first time I saw Korra Book
1, one of my favorite things was the Metal

00:03:32.659 --> 00:03:36.439
Bending Police force going all spider man
with the cables all over the city. It was

00:03:36.439 --> 00:03:41.299
the perfect example of how bending had become
more sophisticated in the 70 years since Avatar

00:03:41.299 --> 00:03:42.059
Last Airbender.

00:03:42.059 --> 00:03:45.629
To be fair, Meelo fart bending was a funnier
example.

00:03:45.629 --> 00:03:51.370
There was this scene of Lin Beifong in the
trailer though that got me so pumped up. It

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:55.739
was of her inside a Metalbending Academy.
There wasn't a lot of context, but the scene

00:03:55.739 --> 00:04:00.589
is part of those leaked episodes, so if you
want to talk about it please use spoiler tags.

00:04:00.589 --> 00:04:04.669
I know everyone wants to know about the new
Airbending sub-form, but right now metalbending

00:04:04.669 --> 00:04:09.159
is still my favorite. Blood Bending is kind
of cool, but something about metalbending

00:04:09.159 --> 00:04:11.159
reminds me of fullmetal alchemist.

00:04:11.159 --> 00:04:15.629
I'm actually hoping we get to see some Beifong
metal weapon crafting. I always thought Lin

00:04:15.629 --> 00:04:20.070
putting on her metal armor in Books 1 and
2 was a subtle Iron Man reference.

00:04:20.070 --> 00:04:23.290
Number 3 - Su Jin, Lin Beifong's Half Sister

00:04:23.290 --> 00:04:27.120
Based on the information we have right now
I think Su Jin will be the most important

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:31.690
person in Lin's story during Book 3. I know
all of you guys want to know where Toph is,

00:04:31.690 --> 00:04:37.600
but as of right now she is alive, but whereabouts
unknown. Making Su Jin the most important

00:04:37.600 --> 00:04:39.940
member in Lin's family by default.

00:04:39.940 --> 00:04:43.520
That doesn't mean Toph won't appear in Book
3 or Book 4, it just means she's a non-entity

00:04:43.520 --> 00:04:47.850
for the time being. Like a ghost that haunts
Lin. Not ghost in the sense of spirits, like

00:04:47.850 --> 00:04:49.500
Uncle Iroh last year.

00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:54.680
Su Jin is part of the Metal Bending clan storyline,
so we might not meet her until the second

00:04:54.680 --> 00:04:58.910
or third episode, but expect some heavy drama
during their early family scenes.

00:04:58.910 --> 00:05:02.660
Usually when someone like Lin never chooses
to talk about her past or her family, it's

00:05:02.660 --> 00:05:06.890
because something bad happened. Speaking of
which, we are going to find out how Lin got

00:05:06.890 --> 00:05:08.760
that scar on her face.

00:05:08.760 --> 00:05:14.940
If you loved all the Aang Republic City flashbacks
in book 1, you're going to love the Lin/Toph

00:05:14.940 --> 00:05:19.580
flashbacks in Book 3. I'm not expecting to
see any flashbacks until after the second

00:05:19.580 --> 00:05:23.640
episode. Book 3 is supposed to pick up a couple
of months after the end of Book 2. So they'll

00:05:23.640 --> 00:05:30.640
still be dealing with the aftermath of the
Dark Avatar.

00:05:31.480 --> 00:05:33.700
Number 2 - Old Man Zuko

00:05:33.700 --> 00:05:37.320
If you didn't read The Search or The Promise
comics, you really haven't seen Zuko since

00:05:37.320 --> 00:05:42.110
Last Airbender went off the air. It was said
in those stories that sometime after becoming

00:05:42.110 --> 00:05:48.560
Firelord Zuko and starting a family, he passed
the title of Firelord to his daughter and

00:05:48.560 --> 00:05:51.300
started traveling the world as an ambassador
for peace.

00:05:51.300 --> 00:05:54.570
Based on the trailers it seems like recently
he's been working with the Order of the White

00:05:54.570 --> 00:05:57.820
Lotus. Or maybe he's been working with them
this whole time.

00:05:57.820 --> 00:06:01.330
It seems like slowly as week get closer and
closer to Book 4 the surviving members of

00:06:01.330 --> 00:06:05.860
the Original Team Avatar start manifesting
themselves. That makes me curious if Toph

00:06:05.860 --> 00:06:12.810
won't appear till Book 4.

00:06:12.810 --> 00:06:19.810
There's so many unanswered Zuko questions
I want answered in Book 3 though. Who was

00:06:20.130 --> 00:06:23.880
his wife, will we meet his daughter, General
Iroh's mother. We met him in Book 2, in case

00:06:23.880 --> 00:06:29.040
you missed it, he was voiced by Dante Basco.
He's not doing the voice for Old Zuko, usually

00:06:29.040 --> 00:06:33.710
when they bring Last Airbender voice actors
back they have them voice new characters.

00:06:33.710 --> 00:06:39.820
That's why Grey Delisle is voicing the evil
waterbender. Currently Azula's whereabouts

00:06:39.820 --> 00:06:45.030
are unknown, even though sparky sparky boom
girl resembles her a lot.

00:06:45.030 --> 00:06:48.660
It seems like a lot of Zuko's story will take
place separately from Korra's, at least at

00:06:48.660 --> 00:06:53.060
the start of Book 3. But I'm hoping we get
to see him teach her some special Firebending

00:06:53.060 --> 00:06:56.090
techniques.
Remember during Book 2 Beginnings, we saw

00:06:56.090 --> 00:07:01.060
Avatar Wan learn the Dragon Dance from the
Dragon spirit, then we saw Zuko and Aang learn

00:07:01.060 --> 00:07:02.180
it during Last Airbender?

00:07:02.180 --> 00:07:09.180
Wouldn't it be cool if he taught it to Korra
at some point. It's true she could have known

00:07:09.470 --> 00:07:13.250
it already because Aang learned it and she
possessed all his memories. But since those

00:07:13.250 --> 00:07:19.920
are gone she won't have that Avatar Hard Drive
to access anymore.

00:07:19.920 --> 00:07:24.830
and the number 1 character I'm looking forward
to is a four way tie for what I'm calling

00:07:24.830 --> 00:07:29.710
the evil bending team. If this were The Karate
Kid movie, they would be Cobra Kai. "No mercy

00:07:29.710 --> 00:07:30.770
in our Dojo"

00:07:30.770 --> 00:07:34.580
I'm hoping that first or second episode introduces
them all. I don't want to talk about them

00:07:34.580 --> 00:07:36.680
too much, but here are their names:

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:40.050
The Firebender, Sparky Sparky Boom girl is
Pey Li

00:07:40.050 --> 00:07:42.320
The Water Bender is Ming Jua

00:07:42.320 --> 00:07:48.600
The Airbender is Zaheer

00:07:48.600 --> 00:07:50.970
and we don't know the name of the Earthbender
yet.

00:07:50.970 --> 00:07:56.310
They have a weird history with Korra when
she was a baby that Zuko will explain. There's

00:07:56.310 --> 00:08:01.410
rumors that part of Book 3 will involve a
plot about controlling future Avatars. If

00:08:01.410 --> 00:08:05.960
you can predict which Bending tribe the next
avatar will come from, you can influence the

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:08.220
next Avatar if you're sneaky enough.

00:08:08.220 --> 00:08:13.000
It's unclear how the evil bending team is
tied up in all this, but there's going to

00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:18.280
be so many classic avatar last airbender callbacks,
if you were a fan of that series. You're going

00:08:18.280 --> 00:08:19.450
to love Book 3.

00:08:19.450 --> 00:08:24.419
Now it's your turn, let me know which character
you're most excited about in Book 3.

00:08:24.419 --> 00:08:30.330
I didn't mention him, but Bolin would be my
bonus choice, fingers crossed Bolin learns

00:08:30.330 --> 00:08:32.469
to metalbend this year.

